    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D.E.L.I.V.E.R.E.R.S. is a fast-paced multiplayer platformer where you and your fruity friends fight your way up in a deadly vertical world. Loot and make some credits. Pay tribute to the overlord to live or defy him to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>   </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, sneak, and smash your way through traps, enemies, and secrets in chaotic co-op action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore bizarre biomes and vertical dungeons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684080/extras/2a41e00ea0782c10dde207536278e848.avif?t=1747459764\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Sell everything you can carry.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684080/extras/25442184ef7cc3729bb3433a9c541a6c.avif?t=1747459764\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your gear and evolve your juicy character.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684080/extras/18f97fca69b21207d7b00f698bfdaea3.avif?t=1747459764\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overthrow the overlord or pay your monthly nonsense tax to avoid spontaneous combustion!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684080/extras/217827fdffd4a15720e88da0df3d439a.avif?t=1747459764\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you sweet enough to survive? Or will you rot trying?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always remember this. You and your fruit gang are D.E.L.I.V.E.R.E.R.S.! A fearless crew on a mission to Discover, Explore, Loot, Infiltrate, Vanquish, Evolve, Recruit, Empower, Reign, and ultimately... Survive!</p>",
